Decimal-valued fields were compared numerically; all other compared fields matched exactly. Both reported cleanup_complete=true, no qualification or replay, and no render-rejected committed experiment. Runtime04's role_calls=0 reflects its recorded controller provenance and does not erase its five role packages. Neither archive proves the required future two evaluated feedback rounds.

Before and after maps exactly match the accepted C-a baseline: runtime04 has 579 unchanged files and actual06 has 83. A final second preservation comparison also passed; all 21 checked host sources remained unchanged during collection. The current-runtime CLI/default path was not rerun or bypassed. Historical API success does not claim that the old context-sensitive runtime04 executor identity can be reconstructed.

## Next permitted step

After independent consolidated review, prepare C-c with a distinct fresh campaign/root, exact manifest/config/outbound initial packet composition, finite lifecycle and paid call/token reserves, explicit two-evaluated-round success rule, fixed environment/deadline/cleanup authority, and one saved launch. No parent reevaluation or evaluator rebuild is justified by these host-only changes. Obtain a fresh separate execution grant only after that complete proposal is reviewable. The old remaining grant cannot fund the minimum six role calls and must not be reused as authority for a replacement run.

## Material limits carried forward

No tests or synthetic cases were read, created or run for this transition. Negative and absent-state branches have static evidence only. The following positive paths remain unexecuted under current changes: dynamic omission of a zero rejection count, committed closed rejection with checkpoint/cleanup, positive feedback metric, rejection-only/duplicate-only/mixed or multiple-evaluated finalization, parent-identical duplication and full novelty closure. A future real campaign may exercise some; it must not be represented as guaranteed coverage.

The historical reader recognizes authenticated recorded semantics and original per-round configuration; it does not reconstruct unsaved historical environment or host-contract preimages. Live launch identity checks remain separate. Immutable census observes evidence and is not a concurrent-writer lock.

Development evidence uses the provisional SP500 bundle. It does not establish final three-universe production validity, held-out qualification, replay readiness or promotion. Zero-trade baselines motivate investigation without establishing a cause. New paid execution remains a separate final user grant after C-c's concrete reviewed preparation.
